sMatter, just the same as #WhiteLivesMatter and #BlueLivesMatters. In reality, #AllLivesMatter.\n\nHowever, the distinction is that, right now, life is not being treated equally, both in the concept of color and the concept of liberty.","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":true,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":7,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1280191587788574720,"date":1594056433000,"rawContent":"It's about building up.\n#BlackLivesMatter\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/pKld8KnIbH","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":8,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1280223151817777152,"date":1594063959000,"rawContent":"\"People are disturbed not by things, but by the view they take of them.\"\n\n- Epictetus\n\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":9,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1280353431111102464,"date":1594095020000,"rawContent":"Black, White, doesn't matter the color of the victim or the assailant, this was a cop executing a citizen. Police culture needs a SERIOUS restructuring.\n\n#BlackLivesMatter #JusticeForJames","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":10,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1283149207377817600,"date":1594761585000,"rawContent":"The people who claim to be against government oppression are the same people who turn a blind eye to government oppression, simply because it is not they who are being oppressed.\n#BlackLivesMatter","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":11,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1288719280196870145,"date":1596089594000,"rawContent":"Well, that's not creepy, or ominous.\n#PDXprotests #BlackLivesMatter #FedsOut","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":"PDXYangGang","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":12,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":1,"sumOfMeToo":0,"sumOfClimate":2,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1289096446650675200,"date":1596179517000,"rawContent":"It seems like a lot of people don't seem to be able to visualize a world where the police could be perceived as a threat, and as such, they can't empathize with the point of view of the protesters.\n#pdxprotest #blacklivesmatter #Protests","userId":1105621009795670016,"media":null,"username":